            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Taz Hes 35:6-32; Kumb 4:41-43; 19:1-13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kisha Mwenyezi-Mungu akamwambia Yoshua, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "awaambie Waisraeli hivi: “Jichagulieni miji ambamo mtu aweza kukimbilia usalama ambayo nilimwambia Mose akueleze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtu yeyote akimuua mtu bila kukusudia anaweza kukimbilia katika mji mmojawapo na hivyo kumkwepa yule mtu aliye na jukumu la kulipiza kisasi cha damu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwuaji atakimbilia katika mji mmojawapo na kusimama mlangoni mwa mji na kuwaeleza wazee wa mji huo kesi yake. Wazee watampokea ndani na kumpa mahali pa kuishi pamoja nao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yule mwenye kulipiza kisasi akimwandama mpaka mjini, wazee wa mji huo hawaruhusiwi kumtoa mwuaji huyo kwa yule mwenye kulipiza kisasi, maana alimuua mwenzake kwa bahati mbaya, kwa vile hapakuwa na uadui kati yao hapo awali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwuaji ataendelea kuishi humo mpaka hapo atakapohukumiwa mbele ya jumuiya nzima ya Israeli na pia mpaka hapo yule kuhani mkuu ambaye alikuwa na madaraka wakati huo amefariki. Baada ya hapo mtu huyo ataweza kurudi nyumbani kwake katika mji ule alikotoroka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, kwa ajili hiyo wakaitenga miji ya Kedeshi katika Galilaya kwenye milima ya Naftali, Shekemu katika milima ya Efraimu na Kiriath-arba (yaani Hebroni) katika nchi ya milima ya Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika ngambo ya mto Yordani, mashariki ya mji wa Yeriko, walichagua mji wa Bezeri ulio kwenye nyika tambarare na ambao mji wenyewe ni wa eneo la kabila la Reubeni. Pia walichagua Ramothi huko Gileadi ambao ni mji wa kabila la Gadi na Golani huko Bashani katika eneo la kabila la Manase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 20:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hii ndiyo miji iliyotengwa kwa ajili ya watu wote wa Israeli na wageni walioishi miongoni mwao, ili mtu yeyote atakayemuua mwenzake bila kukusudia akimbilie huko asije akauawa na mwenye jukumu la kulipiza kisasi cha damu, hadi hapo atakapohukumiwa mbele ya jumuiya nzima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.20.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.20.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
